3. Restrictions
   You must not, directly or indirectly:
   3.1. Bypass Infrastructure or Security: Disable, strip, patch, emulate, or
   bypass admission, authentication, permit checks ("nodemp-host-permit",
   "nodemp-player-permit"), directory credentials ("host_id", "host_secret"),
   cryptographic signatures ("minisign"), TLS/CA verification, or mandatory
   communication with https://api.nodemp.com.
   3.2. Alternative Networks: Connect any part of the NodeMP Software to
   unofficial master servers, directories, or API emulators, or use any part of
   the NodeMP Software to build an alternative or competing multiplayer backend
   or network.
   3.3. Reverse Engineering & Tampering: Decompile, disassemble, or
   deobfuscate protected Lua, JavaScript, or native builds of the NodeMP
